     A* WORKERS' COMP CANCELATION NOTICE CRITERIA WORK FILE
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  DESCRIPTIONS:                                                *
     A*  A TEMPORARY FILE TO HOLD THE SELECTION CRITERIA FROM THE     *
     A*  "BUILD CANCELLATION NOTICE FILE" OPTION--ONE RECORD FOR EACH *
     A*  RUN.  ALL EMPLOYERS WHO MEET THESE SAME CRITERIA ARE LISTED  *
     A*  IN THE 'CANCELLATION NOTICE WORKFILE'.  THIS FILE ACTS AS A  *
     A*  GUIDE OR HEADER TO THAT WORKFILE FOR THE "CANCELLATION NOTICE*
     A*  MAINTENANCE" OPTION.                                         *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  CREATED: 11/15/96 C:57 PROJECT CM024                         *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 11/21/19  C:180  PROJECT 102WIC                               *
     A*                  Add State Inclusion/Exclusion fields.        *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 03/07/05 C:136 PROJECT: WC1199 (REVAMPT DUNNING II)           *
     A*                POPULATE CCINCP TO INDICATE THAT DEPOSIT IS    *
     A*                INCLUDED IN BALANCE CALCULATION.               *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 05/02/03 C:61  PROJECT: WC1108                                *
     A*                Add flag for Batch Based on Amount/Premium.    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 02/18/03 C:136 PROJECT: WC1115 (PREM/PAYROLL IMPORT/EXPORT)   *
     A*                Add field for reporting frequency, 'M' -       *
     A*                'M' - monthly, 'W' - weekly, 'B' - Both        *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 08/13/02  C:61   PROJECT: 126WAK                              *
     A*                  Add fields for week ending date and          *
     A*                  exclude after date.                          *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 11/28/00  C:61   PROJECT: 109CF                               *
     A*                  Add Agent# field.                            *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 12/01/99  C:90   PROJECT: WC912                               *
     A*                  ADDED A NEW FIELD FOR THE ESTIMATED/AUDITED  *
     A*                  SELECTION FLAG.                              *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 08/12/99  C:35   PROJECT: WC894                               *
     A*                  ADDED FIELD FOR PAYMENTS THROUGH DATE.       *
     A*                  CHANGED HEADING ON BALANCE DATE TO BILLINGS  *
     A*                  THROUGH DATE.                                *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  08/20/98 C:87 PROJECT WC852                                  *
     A*                ADDED CCOFF# - OFFICE #                        *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
