     A            CCFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            CCFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A                                      COLHDG('FIELD NOT USED')
     A            CCETYP    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('ACCOUNT TYPE')
