     A                                      COLHDG('CANCEL BATCH #')
     A            CCBPF     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('BATCH PROCESSED' 'Y/N')
     A            CCRSN     R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('REASON CODE')
